<title>POLAND: POLISH NBP REJECTS ALL PLN 266 MLN DRAINAGE BIDS.</title>
<headline>POLISH NBP REJECTS ALL PLN 266 MLN DRAINAGE BIDS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland rejected all 266 million zlotys worth of bids at its 200 million zloty NBP-bill repurchase auction, the NBP said.</p>
<p>At the last auction the maximum accepted rate was 19.13 percent. -- Warsaw Newsroom +48 2 653 9700</p>
</text>
